Package: PracticalBayesianRegressionR
Type: Package
Title: 'brms'-Style Bayesian Regression with a Julia Back End
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Arthur", "Newbury", email = "a.r.newbury@exeter.ac.uk",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fit Bayesian regression models -- generalised linear, multilevel
    and distributional models -- with the formula, family and prior syntax of
    'brms'. Models are fitted by 'PracticalBayesianRegression.jl', which
    builds each model's log density and its gradient in closed form from the
    formula and samples it with its own NUTS. A model can also be compiled
    once into a standalone executable that is kept in a model store shared
    with the Julia package; a compiled model refits to new data without
    starting Julia at all.
